    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=0.50</mo></math><br /><br />Here,<br /><br />i= van&#39;t hoff factor<br /><br /><math> <mi>&#945;</mi> </math> =degree of dissociation<br /><br />k= total number of ions(dissociated)<br /><br />&nbsp;"
